<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's CPFL cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's CPFL cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Paola Castelini cut her rating for Companhia Paulista de Forca e Luz SA, or CPFL, to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, she said she cut the rating because the stock had reached the year-end 1997 target price.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 0.01 real to 195 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
